## Standard Project Layer Mapping

Map these canonical roles onto the active repository's folder structure:

| Layer | Typical Paths | Role |
| --- | --- | --- |
| Feature Modules | `lib/features/<name>/`, `src/features/<name>/` | Vertical slices: state controller (`cubit/`/`bloc/`/`stores/`), `data/`, `ui/` |
| Theme & Design Tokens | `lib/ui/resources/`, `src/styles/tokens.css` | Semantic color getters, typography scale (`font*W*`), script-aware fonts |
| Shared UI Primitives | `lib/ui/widgets/`, `src/components/ui/` | App bars, cached images, inputs, sheets, dialogs, skeletons, badges |
| Core Utilities & Services | `lib/utils/`, `lib/core/`, `src/lib/` | Structured logger (`appLog`), crypto/workers, sync helpers, tap guard, typed errors |
| Localization | `lib/l10n/` (`*.arb`), `src/lib/i18n/`, `locales/` | Synchronized locale dictionaries (`en`, `ar`, etc.) with RTL/LTR support |
| Environment & Config | `lib/*_options.dart`, `src/config/`, `.env*` | Centralized backend/DB endpoints and public keys (never hardcoded) |

